  "_comment": "Recruitment requirements for Part I, keyed by the character you are recruiting and the Flame Lord you are playing. Only rows the source labels with an explicit route are published: 37 rows. Rows for the other Flame Lords appear in the source inside a cross-table whose column association does not survive flattening, so they are deliberately omitted rather than guessed at.",
  "_mechanics": {
    "screen": "Recruitment requirements are shown in the Character Info screen when you speak to a character. If no requirement list appears, that unit cannot be recruited.",
    "bondLevel": "Bond Level tracks how close your Flame Lord is to the recruit and starts at level 1 for everyone. Giving at least one gift starts the process.",
    "renownLevel": "Renown Level is the account-wide progression stat, raised by story missions, subquests and Flame Lord specific tasks.",
    "bond3": "Bond Level 2 develops quickly; Bond Level 3 takes considerably more effort, meals and money.",
    "negotiation": "Some recruits end with a negotiation dialogue in which the right dialogue choices must be picked.",
    "unknowns": "Some units show question marks instead of a requirement, which means further story progress is needed first.",
    "routeExclusive": "Some Flame Lords can recruit units that others cannot."
